Value Required VERSION (\S+)
Value HOSTNAME (\S+)
Value UPTIME (\S.*?)
Value MODEL (\S.*?)
Value SERIAL (\S+)

Start
  ^\s*(?:NXOS|system):\s+version\s+${VERSION}\s*$$
  ^\s*cisco\s+${MODEL}\s+[Cc]hassis\b
  ^\s*Processor\s+Board\s+ID\s+${SERIAL}\s*$$
  ^\s*Device\s+name:\s+${HOSTNAME}\s*$$
  ^\s*Kernel\s+uptime\s+is\s+${UPTIME}\s*$$
